# Pinata JWT for IPFS pinning.
# Required in production. When unset, POST /storage/pin falls back to a
# local filesystem mock under ${LOCAL_IPFS_DIR:-.ponder/local-ipfs} and
# GET /ipfs/:cid serves blobs back from that dir. Use the local mode for
# dev so you do not need a Pinata account.
PINATA_JWT=

# Optional override for the local-mock storage dir.
# LOCAL_IPFS_DIR=.ponder/local-ipfs
